OL,3,GNEWSADriver dies in crash after police
OL,4,Apursuit
OL,5,
OL,6,FA driver has died in a single-vehicle
OL,7,Fcrash following a pursuit involving a
OL,8,Fmarked police car.
OL,10,FBedfordshire Police said officers were
OL,11,Falerted to a grey Audi being driven
OL,12,Fwithout its lights on in High Street
OL,13,FSouth, Dunstable, at about 22:30 BST on
OL,14,FSaturday.
OL,16,FThe force said the driver, a
OL,17,F41-year-old man, "failed to stop for
OL,18,Fpolice and a police pursuit ensued" on
OL,19,Fthe A5183 towards Markyate, a village
OL,20,Fon the Hertfordshire border.
OL,23,APub: 30-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
